@startuml seq-1-destination-search
' UC1: Search a destination  (client-side fuzzy autocomplete + submit)
title UC1: Destination Search & Autocomplete
autonumber

actor Guest
participant "SearchForm\n<<client>>\n(incl. DestinationAutocomplete)" as Form
participant "FuzzySearch\n(MiniSearch)" as Fuzzy
participant "Next.js Router" as Router


note over Form : DestinationAutocomplete is folded into SearchForm here since\nthe Guest only ever interacts with it through the form;\nsee class diagram for the actual component split

== Type-ahead (sub-100ms, fully client-side) ==
Guest -> Form : type "singa" (destination field)
activate Form
Form -> Fuzzy : searchDestinations(index, "singa", 8)
activate Fuzzy
Fuzzy --> Form : DestinationEntry[] (ranked)
deactivate Fuzzy
Form --> Guest : render suggestion listbox
deactivate Form

Guest -> Form : click "Singapore, Singapore"
activate Form
Form -> Form : onSelect(entry) -> destination = entry
Form --> Guest : show "Singapore, Singapore" in field, close dropdown
note over Form : onTopMatchChange also fires while typing,\nso a typed place + Search works without a click
deactivate Form

== Submit ==
Guest -> Form : pick dates, rooms, adults/children (GuestSelector), click Search
activate Form
alt no destination picked
  Form --> Guest : "Please enter and pick a destination."
end
Form -> Form : validateDates(checkin, checkout, now)
alt invalid (checkin < 3 days out, or checkout <= checkin)
  Form --> Guest : show inline error (role="alert")
else valid
  note right of Form : upstream takes one occupancy count per room,\nso guests = adults + children
  Form -> Router : push("/search?\n  destination_id=..&checkin=..&checkout=..\n  &rooms=..&guests=..\n  &currency=SGD&country_code=SG&lang=en_US")
  activate Router
  Router --> Guest : navigate to results page (UC2)
  deactivate Router
deactivate Form
end
@enduml
